                        "form_id": "2697e40f-cba0-4d60-84d1-740c4c561750",
                        "entry_id": "acdc9f3b-b159-32dc-abc6-3eac1577fd19",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "несказа́ннее"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "ec193ba0-8b02-4c04-bee3-4f1905ad4918",
                        "entry_id": "acdc9f3b-b159-32dc-abc6-3eac1577fd19",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "несказа́нней"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46085542-f21e-3e9b-8dda-619bafffe37b",
                        "entry_id": "acdc9f3b-b159-32dc-abc6-3eac1577fd19",
                        "glosses": [
                            "высок., трад.-поэт. такой, который трудно выразить словами; неописуемый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a5e9118-8071-45dd-ba5f-4282180d29fb",
                                "sense_id": "46085542-f21e-3e9b-8dda-619bafffe37b",
                                "text": "Несказа́нное величие этого зрелища меня сразило: увлеченный им, я стал на колена перед святынею материнской скорби, перед головою царицы, лежащей в прахе под крестом испытующего Спасителя."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8add1c9b-693f-49ce-bcf7-a81eb70e9378",
                                "sense_id": "46085542-f21e-3e9b-8dda-619bafffe37b",
                                "text": "Несказа́нное мгновенье! // Лишь изрек, свершив моленье, // Предстоявший алтарю: // Память вечная Царю!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f8a999a-d8c0-4743-8451-1ee580dad504",
                                "sense_id": "46085542-f21e-3e9b-8dda-619bafffe37b",
                                "text": "Предавшись думам несказа́нным, // И здесь я, на закате дня, // Спешу к местам обетованным, // К могилам чуждым, безымянным, // Но не безмолвным для меня."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bfc1e614-585c-3b98-b12a-7b6850b25725",
                        "entry_id": "acdc9f3b-b159-32dc-abc6-3eac1577fd19",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., разг. очень сильный; чрезвычайный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f6f77fd-a3a9-4bb9-9bfd-b9f0e56d77cf",
                                "sense_id": "bfc1e614-585c-3b98-b12a-7b6850b25725",
                                "text": "Нашёл сии две небольшие лодки, и радость теперь моя несказанна; вы все спасены."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bb08916-2319-4848-9354-f8d565abd4fd",
                                "sense_id": "bfc1e614-585c-3b98-b12a-7b6850b25725",
                                "text": "Я ощутил в себе несказа́нную решимость. Душа так и рвалась из тела вон!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "900a84c4-5f29-4c8d-a1a2-c040fb402d58",
                                "sense_id": "bfc1e614-585c-3b98-b12a-7b6850b25725",
                                "text": "Всякую минуту выглядывала она из окна и видела, к несказа́нной досаде, что всё ещё остается полдороги."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "acec094e-cf7b-4ac9-b014-2efaa0ee9392",
                                "sense_id": "bfc1e614-585c-3b98-b12a-7b6850b25725",
                                "text": "Она шла за ним без сопротивления; её бледное лицо, неподвижные глаза, все её движения выражали несказа́нное изумление."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cf1c9615-5589-4c43-a88a-37ac80b94943",
                        "source_entry_id": "acdc9f3b-b159-32dc-abc6-3eac1577fd19",
                        "target_lang_word": "unspeakable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unspeakable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a4ddaf8-96a4-3e59-a29e-73992f441441",
                                        "entry_id": "58110c1f-9849-388a-8ff0-6f4131abf32a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incapable of being spoken or uttered"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b5860dd-b53e-4a65-90ef-c83e80869452",
                                                "sense_id": "6a4ddaf8-96a4-3e59-a29e-73992f441441",
                                                "text": "1855-1882, Walt Whitman, Leaves of Grass, book xv,\nThe endless pride and outstretching of man, unspeakable joys and sorrows."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0d44db7-322d-33b3-a98c-134849742748",
                                        "entry_id": "58110c1f-9849-388a-8ff0-6f4131abf32a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Impossible to speak about."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d10f95f-cf8f-41c5-b9a2-eff4e3ffb6bb",
                                                "sense_id": "e0d44db7-322d-33b3-a98c-134849742748",
                                                "text": "It is true that during the first week hardly a day passed that Erskine did not address himself to Watt, on the subject of Watt's duties. But in the first week Watt's words had not yet begun to fail him, or Watt's world to become unspeakable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6bc6aea-15ad-36cd-afc8-b512cce102a0",
                                        "entry_id": "58110c1f-9849-388a-8ff0-6f4131abf32a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unfit or not permitted to be spoken or described."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9d08d8f-903e-46f0-9454-77584496d28d",
                                                "sense_id": "b6bc6aea-15ad-36cd-afc8-b512cce102a0",
                                                "text": "The miser will remember his hoard of gold, the robber his ill-gotten wealth, the angry and revengeful and merciless murderers their deeds of blood and violence in which they revelled, the impure and adulterous the unspeakable and filthy pleasures in which they delighted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b64f807-c0d0-3cdd-ba38-c663378e6c11",
                                        "entry_id": "58110c1f-9849-388a-8ff0-6f4131abf32a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extremely bad or objectionable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aafce8e0-8df0-4b18-8c55-dfb168671ff7",
                                                "sense_id": "7b64f807-c0d0-3cdd-ba38-c663378e6c11",
                                                "text": "an unspeakable fool"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37d7cb17-1655-4dd5-9b65-83e94c7a30bb",
                                                "sense_id": "7b64f807-c0d0-3cdd-ba38-c663378e6c11",
                                                "text": "an unspeakable play"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7919d7cf-df69-45b2-9319-500575347450",
                                                "sense_id": "7b64f807-c0d0-3cdd-ba38-c663378e6c11",
                                                "text": "Yet to my horror I saw in its eaten-away and bone-revealing outlines a leering, abhorrent travesty on the human shape; and in its mouldy, disintegrating apparel an unspeakable quality that chilled me even more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea3a4925-4927-42f6-b090-7429d55b7705",
                                                "sense_id": "7b64f807-c0d0-3cdd-ba38-c663378e6c11",
                                                "text": "Anyone who goes into a voting booth on November the 8th and comes out saying, “I feel a hundred percent great about what I just did in there!,” is either lying to themselves, or did something unspeakable in that booth! And that means, as uncomfortable as this is, everyone has to own the floors of whoever you vote for, whether they are a lying handsy narcissistic sociopath, a hawkish Wall Street-friendly embodiment of everything that some people can’t stand about politics, an ill-tempered mountain molester with a radical dangerous tax plan that even he can’t defend, or a conspiracy-pandering political neophyte with no clear understanding of how government operates and who once recorded this folk rap about the virtues of bicycling."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "008260df-ae36-3205-b9c0-04ca3b329855",
                                        "entry_id": "58110c1f-9849-388a-8ff0-6f4131abf32a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That cannot be referenced in source code, due to having no usable name."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a807b5d0-cbe6-415c-8c66-579fa30e6ae6",
                                                "sense_id": "008260df-ae36-3205-b9c0-04ca3b329855",
                                                "text": "an instance of an unspeakable type"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1058f030-a4f7-43b7-84e3-e265b6a19541",
                                                "sense_id": "008260df-ae36-3205-b9c0-04ca3b329855",
                                                "text": "unspeakable field names"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unspeakable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01c87e8d-b3b1-33a2-aaf4-17fd6848e18e",
                                        "entry_id": "8a5c7a21-be5e-3061-b718-4e63e7b7f37f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that cannot or must not be spoken about."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7144aca-175a-4a82-9565-5fa9c4af3368",
                                                "sense_id": "01c87e8d-b3b1-33a2-aaf4-17fd6848e18e",
                                                "text": "The longer we don't speak about the unspeakables, the more harm they do to the relationship."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
